unpredictable, and survival depends on teamwork, awareness, and keeping your sanity intact. More levels, mechanics, and horrors are planned, with even more on the way.", "short_description": "Dreambound is a liminal horror\u2013themed multiplayer experience. In lobbies of up to four players, you and your friends are dropped into the Backrooms, where your only goal is to survive and find a way out. Strange spaces, constant tension, and the feeling that something is watching make every escape uncertain."}]}, "developer_name": "GoodSoup", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/dreamboundvr/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Aero Monk Studios", "support_website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/dreamboundvr/contact?authuser=0", "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/dreamboundvr/home?authuser=0", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "CO_OP"], "id": "26374979025432909"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1263587099273551"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1263587099273551"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1778536800, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1263587099273551"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBina